               step('The first-stage impeller raises velocity and pressure; this stage sets the pump\'s NPSH requirement.', 'impeller_1', overlay='pressure'),
               step('The diffuser vanes around the impeller slow the liquid and convert velocity into pressure.', 'stage_casing_1', overlay='pressure'),
               step('Return vanes guide the liquid inward, without swirl, to the eye of the next impeller.', 'stage_casing_2', overlay='flow'),
